ator (not built)\" data-reason=\"build status reflects live game state\">not built</span></h2>\n<button class=\"shrink-0 cursor-pointer text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"clear target button\">Clear target</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.3] text-[var(--body)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"factory description\" data-reason=\"description depends on which building is selected as target\">Builds armored vehicles. Max level 20.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-[10px] mt-2.5 border-l border-[var(--hairline)] pl-[15px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"building requirements list\">\n<div class=\"relative pb-3\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1\" data-name=\"City Hall requirement item\">\n<span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] top-[8px] h-px w-[11px] bg-[var(--hairline)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"requirement connector line\"></span>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"City Hall requirement row\">\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"City Hall requirement label\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"city hall icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 96 96\"><use href=\"#b-cityhall\"></use></svg>\n              City Hall\n            </span>\n<span class=\"mono text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"City Hall level progress (4/10)\">4<span class=\"text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2-2-1\"> / 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"mono ml-auto text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"City Hall time remaining\" data-reason=\"countdown timer updates every second\">30m 20s</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mono mt-1 flex items-center gap-3 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-3\" data-name=\"City Hall resource cost row\">\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\" data-kid=