uirements submenu\">\n<span class=\"absolute -left-px top-[8px] h-px w-[10px] bg-[var(--hairline)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"submenu connector line\"></span>\n<button class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"requirements met button\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-3-5-2-1\" data-name=\"check icon wrapper\"><i class=\"icon-check\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-3-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n              Requirements met: Barracks 1\n              <span class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-3-5-2-2\" data-name=\"submenu expand control\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-3-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"chevron-right icon\"></i></span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<button class=\"mt-2 flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 border-t border-[var(--hairline)] pt-1.5 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-3\" data-name=\"all buildings expand button\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-3-1\" data-name=\"all buildings count label\">All 18 buildings</span>\n<span class=\"mono text-[var(--muted)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-3-2\" data-name=\"built count label\" data-reason=\"built count updates with game state\">9 built</span>\n<span class=\"ml-auto text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-3-3\" data-name=\"expand control\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-3-3-1\" data-name=\"chevron-right icon\"></i></span>\n</button>\n<div class=\"mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-[var(--hairline)] pt-1.5 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-4\" data-name=\"terrain (land) modifiers row\">\n<span class=\"text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-4-1\" data-name=\"terrain label\">Land</span>\n<span class=\"ml-auto flex items-baseline gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-4-2\" data-name=\"modifier group\">\n<span class=\"text-[var(--body)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-4-2-1\" data-name=\"food multiplier modifier\">Food <